# SynapseOS — syntty's own words.
#
# ⚠ The msgids are GENERATED into po/syntty.pot by po/pot.sh; merge with
# msgmerge. syntty draws its own window, so there is no JSON half to this
# catalog — it is compiled once to a .mo and read through libintl.
#
# ⛔ WHAT IS **NOT** IN HERE IS THE POINT. Every subcommand's stdout — dump,
# about, win --stats, render, fit, mouse, key, paste, config --example — is
# parsed by tests/syntty_test.sh and by whoever automates this terminal, so it
# is never marked and never translated. What is here is what goes to stderr
# when something has gone wrong, which is the only text a person reads.
#
# ⚠ AND THE LITERAL TOKENS STAY LITERAL. `mouse:`, `--resize`, `COLSxROWS`,
# `shift`, `press` and `syntty -e` are things somebody TYPES; translating one
# hands them a command that does not exist.
#
